sequenceDiagram
  participant Drv as molt driver
  participant Dut as odc-device-*
  participant FC as Flight controller UART
  participant Rtr as mavlink.router
  participant Gcs as GCS client TCP/UDP

  Note over Drv,Gcs: Phases A/B — see suite-mavlink-full for VPN extender path
  Drv->>Dut: apply mav-router-only fixture
  Drv->>Rtr: start mav_primary
  Rtr->>FC: open /dev/ttyACM0
  FC-->>Rtr: heartbeats / MAVLink frames
  Drv->>Gcs: connect DUT:5760 or :14550
  Gcs-->>Drv: messages received
  Note over Dut: Phases A/B: no vpn / rtsp / cellular required
  Drv->>Rtr: stop start + daemon restart cases
